{"type":"message","id":"9e3621b3","parentId":"ec9ac563","timestamp":"2026-03-13T18:50:15.825Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Sat 2026-03-14 02:50 GMT+8] [Subagent Context] You are running as a subagent (depth 1/2). Results auto-announce to your requester; do not busy-poll for status.\n\n[Subagent Task]: 作为查事小弟，用playwright访问厦门市软件行业协会网站 http://www.xmsia.cn/Pages/Home/NewsList.aspx?classId=3，分析页面结构，提取以下CSS选择器：\n1. 公告列表容器选择器（所有公告条目的父元素）\n2. 单个公告条目选择器\n3. 公告标题选择器\n4. 公告跳转链接选择器\n5. 公告发布日期选择器\n返回选择器和验证结果，确保能正确提取到最新公告内容。"}],"timestamp":1773427815823}}
{"type":"message","id":"fd371cba","parentId":"9e3621b3","timestamp":"2026-03-13T18:50:28.964Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\nGot it, let's tackle this task. First, I need to use Playwright to visit that URL, right? Let me first check if Playwright is installed? Wait no, first I should write a small script to fetch the page and get the selectors. Let's create a Node.js script that uses Playwright to load the page, inspect the elements, extract the selectors and verify they work.\n\nWait, first let me write the script. Let's create a file called get-xmsia-selectors.js. Let's use Playwright Chromium to visit the page, then evaluate the elements.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_mjhmppkoce58w0pv2t4vk8ud","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"/home/yankeeting/.openclaw/workspace/get-xmsia-selectors.js","content":"const { chromium } = require('playwright');\n\n(async () => {\n  const browser = await chromium.launch({ headless: true });\n  const page = await browser.newPage();\n  \n  console.log('正在访问厦门市软件行业协会公告页面...');\n  await page.goto('http://www.xmsia.cn/Pages/Home/NewsList.aspx?classId=3', { waitUntil: 'networkidle', timeout: 30000 });\n  \n  // 提取选择器\n  const selectors = await page.evaluate(() => {\n    // 查找公告列表容器\n    const listContainer = document.querySelector('.newslist-left ul') || document.querySelector('.news-list ul') || document.querySelector('[class*=\"list\"] ul');\n    const containerSelector = listContainer ? getCssSelector(listContainer) : null;\n    \n    // 单个公告条目\n    const items = listContainer ? Array.from(listContainer.querySelectorAll('li')) : [];\n    const itemSelector = items.length ? containerSelector + ' > li' : null;\n    \n    // 标题、链接、日期选择器\n    let titleSelector, linkSelector, dateSelector;\n    if (items.length) {\n      const firstItem = items[0];\n      const titleEl = firstItem.querySelector('a') || firstItem.querySelector('[class*=\"title\"]');\n      const dateEl = firstItem.querySelector('[class*=\"date\"]') || firstItem.querySelector('.time') || firstItem.querySelector('span:last-child');\n      \n      titleSelector = itemSelector + ' ' + getCssSelector(titleEl).replace(itemSelector + ' ', '');\n      linkSelector = itemSelector + ' a';\n      dateSelector = dateEl ? itemSelector + ' ' + getCssSelector(dateEl).replace(itemSelector + ' ', '') : null;\n    }\n    \n    // 辅助函数：生成CSS选择器\n    function getCssSelector(el) {\n      if (!(el instanceof Element)) return null;\n      const path = [];\n      while (el.nodeType === Node.ELEMENT_NODE) {\n        let selector = el.nodeName.toLowerCase();\n        if (el.id) {\n          selector += '#' + el.id;\n          path.unshift(selector);\n          break;\n        } else {\n          let sib = el, nth = 1;\n          while (sib = sib.previousElementSibling) {\n            if (sib.nodeName.toLowerCase() == selector) nth++;\n          }\n          if (nth != 1) selector += \":nth-of-type(\"+nth+\")\";\n        }\n        path.unshift(selector);\n        el = el.parentNode;\n      }\n      return path.join(\" > \");\n    }\n    \n    return {\n      containerSelector,\n      itemSelector,\n      titleSelector,\n      linkSelector,\n      dateSelector\n    };\n  });\n  \n  console.log('\\n提取到的CSS选择器：');\n  console.log('1. 公告列表容器选择器:', selectors.containerSelector);\n  console.log('2. 单个公告条目选择器:', selectors.itemSelector);\n  console.log('3. 公告标题选择器:', selectors.titleSelector);\n  console.log('4. 公告跳转链接选择器:', selectors.linkSelector);\n  console.log('5. 公告发布日期选择器:', selectors.dateSelector);\n  \n  // 验证选择器\n  console.log('\\n===== 验证结果 =====');\n  try {\n    const itemCount = await page.locator(selectors.itemSelector).count();\n    console.log(`找到公告条目数量: ${itemCount}`);\n    \n    if (itemCount > 0) {\n      // 取前3条验证\n      for (let i = 0; i < Math.min(3, itemCount); i++) {\n        const title = await page.locator(selectors.titleSelector).nth(i).textContent();\n        const link = await page.locator(selectors.linkSelector).nth(i).getAttribute('href');\n        const date = await page.locator(selectors.dateSelector).nth(i).textContent();\n        \n        console.log(`\\n公告 ${i+1}:`);\n        console.log(`标题: ${title?.trim()}`);\n        console.log(`链接: http://www.xmsia.cn${link}`);\n        console.log(`日期: ${date?.trim()}`);\n      }\n    }\n  } catch (e) {\n    console.error('选择器验证失败:', e.message);\n  }\n  \n  await browser.close();\n})();\n"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volces-com","model":"ark-code-latest","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773427815824}}
